    "body": "closes #31903\r\ncloses #33392\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\napi functions with a trailing `Dict(...) *opts` param make callers pass it even\r\nwhen empty\r\n\r\ne.g. `nvim_exec2('echo 1', {})`.\r\n\r\nNOTE: |api-contract| already permits\r\nomitting it, the code is just out of sync\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nstand on the shoulders of giants and pick up @juditnovak's work in #33392",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-13T14:28:24Z",
